    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a really heavy way to look at it. It's just... when you say \"the only honest choice,\" it's like you're saying that fighting against the void is actually a kind of delusion? Like, we're all just pretending there's a reason to wake up every day when the math says there isn't one. It makes me feel so exhausted, just pretending.",
