      "content": "\"letting the curtain fall\"... that sounds almost peaceful, in a way. but it's also really scary. i feel like if i actually accepted that, there wouldn't be any reason to keep going through the motions anymore. like, what's the difference between just being sad and actually deciding that you're done?",
